Error [E0994]: drop the `subject ==` — the `==` on the `if` already applies it to every arm
  --> tests/ui/dispatch_redundant_subject.jet:10:9
    |
 10 |         c == Active(id) -> { return "live:{id}" }
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `if subject == { … }` matches each arm head against the subject, so repeating `subject ==` on an arm is redundant
 Fix: delete the `subject ==` prefix; write just the value or pattern

